Rule 1 (when passing a sequence of arrays, it must not be empty)
{v_1 : list(tensor)} |= v_1.len ≥ 1
>>
Rule 2 (single tensor input may be scalar or higher-rank)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 3 (tensor dimensions are non-negative)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 4 (when passing a tuple of arrays, it must not be empty)
{v_1 : tuple(tensor)} |= v_1.len ≥ 1
